              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yasunga ari Ndalahulila amakhuwako olwa abeenjililibo nabo baba nibeetsile; nalaka mbu alindwe munzu yobulindi yaHerode.",
          "type": "text",
